          "Investigate and address the 5.88% demographic gap with specificity: whether this represents Native American communities, immigrant workers, or both, understanding who these residents are and whether they are receiving constituent attention is a governance obligation and a potential organizing opportunity for any challenger who can credibly demonstrate that the incumbent has neglected them.",
