          "Build authentic engagement with the ~3.62% Native American constituency and any other minority communities: unopposed victory means neither engagement nor opposition is active, but any challenger who addresses this community's healthcare and economic development concerns will find real organizing potential.",
          "Understand the difference between demographic safety and electoral safety: 92% white and 79% homeowner does not guarantee voter behavior in a district this economically pressured; economic anxiety and governance performance drive voting more reliably than demographics alone.",
          "Do not campaign this seat as if unopposed means secure: in a district with this income level and this age profile, material economic concerns are the primary voter driver, and any incumbent who takes the seat for granted risks losing to an opponent who takes those concerns seriously."
