          "Maintain active presence in district on cost-of-living issues: inflation, healthcare premiums, property taxes, and utility costs are the lived experience of voters at $60K income with limited education credentials; visible legislative work on these issues, not just messaging, is what converts a 100% unopposed result into durable political strength."
