          "Lead with specific material governance on renter concerns: housing affordability, tenant protections, public transit access, and neighborhood-level public safety are the issues that bind a 45.9% renter constituency together — abstract messaging on values or historical party affiliation will not consolidate this electorate.",
          "Engage Black, Hispanic, and Asian communities with specificity rather than generic minority outreach: Black voters require authentic engagement on neighborhood disinvestment and public safety; Hispanic voters on housing costs and economic mobility; Asian voters on public safety and business environment — failing to differentiate allows opposition to organize along ethnic lines and fragment the coalition.",
