          "Develop substantive positions on tax fairness and property tax management for a constituency of $113,000+ income homeowners with 77.6% ownership rates; abstract anti-tax messaging will underperform with educated voters who understand both the value of public services and the burden of actual tax bills.",
          "Recognize that 58% in a district this demographically favorable to Republicans is not a dominant hold—it suggests a persuadable middle exists among college-educated professionals, and any incumbent strategy that assumes base consolidation rather than active persuasion is misreading the margin."
