          "Recognize that unopposed status in 2024 is not a durable electoral advantage: if a challenger emerges with credible economic messaging to working-class renters or property-tax-burdened homeowners, the margin will contract rapidly; use the current period to establish a constituent relationship so deep that switching representation feels risky to households already managing financial uncertainty."
