          "Lean into renter-specific policy: housing affordability, tenant protections, zoning reform, and transit access are the material concerns of a 52.6% renter constituency. A legislative agenda that treats housing as a constituent service—not an abstract policy discussion—and delivers concrete wins on affordability and access will deepen the coalition's durability.",
