          "Engage the 28.6% renter population with specific attention: renters are economically more fragile than homeowners and more responsive to cost-of-living messaging; demonstrating concrete work on renter protections, affordable housing, or cost relief differentiates from generic Republican positioning and prevents Democratic recruitment.",
