          "Build explicit legislative record on working-class economic delivery: voting record on minimum wage, Medicaid expansion, utility regulation, and rural broadband access should be framed in terms of direct household impact at this income level, not abstract principle; in a low-income district, governance credibility is measured by whether households' material conditions are improving."
