          "Engage the 19.19% minority population (Black, Hispanic, Asian, and AIAN residents) with specific constituent attention and visible representation in legislative priorities; treating these communities as assumed Democratic votes to be ignored or minimized is strategically myopic and tactically dangerous in a district where losing even modest support could shift the margin substantially.",
